For context, the Software includes, to the extent embodied in the
Licensor's own distributed implementation, without limitation:
    (a) the agent team, its prompts, orchestration, and the artifact
        schemas passed between agents;
    (b) storyboard planning, scene segmentation, timing derivation, and
